UID:state-corp-iowa-2025-04-30@ustaxcalendar.com
DTSTAMP:20260924T122623Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20250430
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20250501
SUMMARY:Iowa: State corporate income/franchise tax return due
DESCRIPTION:IA 1120 due the last day of the 4th month after year end (April
  30 for calendar year)\; automatic 6-month extension (to October 30) if 90%
 + of tax was paid by the original due date - filing only\, interest still a
 ccrues. | IA 1120 due the last day of the 4th month after year end (April 3
 0 for calendar year)\; automatic 6-month extension (to October 30) if 90%+ 
 of tax was paid by the original due date - filing only\, interest still acc
 rues. | Authority: Direct fetch of the current (2025 tax year) Iowa Corpora
 tion Income Tax Instructions PDF this session: "Return is due no later than
  April 30\, 2026." "All taxpayers who have paid 90% or more of their correc
 t tax on or before the original due date of their return automatically have
  an additional six months in which to file their return." | Source: https:/
 /revenue.iowa.gov/media/4372/download?inline= | This date is computed from 
 a recurrence rule and may not reflect a later-announced change\; confirm ag
 ainst the cited source before relying on it.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
