SUMMARY:Iowa: IA 1065 due
DESCRIPTION:Iowa partnership return due the last day of the 4th month after
  year-end (April 30 for calendar year) - Iowa uses "last day\," not the 15t
 h-day pattern most other states use\, consistent with this session's other 
 Iowa corrections. | Iowa partnership return due the last day of the 4th mon
 th after year-end (April 30 for calendar year) - Iowa uses "last day\," not
  the 15th-day pattern most other states use\, consistent with this session'
 s other Iowa corrections. Automatic (no extension request form) if the part
 nership owes no Iowa tax\; if a PTET election is made\, automatic extension
  requires at least 90% of tax liability paid by the original due date. | Au
 thority: Iowa Department of Revenue\, direct fetch this session: "the last 
